Common Meals Settled
====================

<% if @settles_meals %>
The common meals in this settlement, through <%= @settled_through %>, are now settled. Their costs are final. If a cost was wrong, an admin can correct it, and the change goes into the next settlement.
<% else %>
This settlement, through <%= @settled_through %>, settles no new meals. It carries corrections to meals settled before.
<% end %>
<% if @cooked %>

Here are the meals you cooked in this settlement, and what you spent on each: <%= @url %>
<% end %>
<% if @corrections.any? %>

<%= @corrections_heading %>
<% @corrections.each do |correction| %>

<%= correction[:date] %>: <%= correction[:words] %> Reason: <%= correction[:reason] %>
<%= correction[:url] %>
<% end %>
<% end %>

Have a great day!
~<%= @community.name %>
